 II is a bright two-bedroom, two-bathroom home in La Campana. The apartment features an open-plan living and dining area that flows into a fully equipped kitchen. Large windows and a south-facing layout fill the space with sunlight all day. The home includes a secure underground parking space and a separate laundry room for everyday convenience.\n\nBoth bedrooms open to a wide terrace that is also accessible from the living room. The master bedroom has an ensuite bathroom with a walk-in shower, while the second bedroom sits beside a modern guest bathroom. Clean design and neutral tones create a calm and welcoming atmosphere.\n\nResidents enjoy access to a rooftop pool with panoramic views. The apartment is close to shops, cafés and transport ‌links. ‌Apartment ‌Albatros ‌II ‌offers ‌easy living ‌in a ‌vibrant area—perfect for a permanent ‌home, ‌a ‌holiday ‌retreat ‌or a strong investment ‌opportunity ‌in ‌Marbella’s ‌sought-after ‌La ‌Campana ‌neighbourhood."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Sur","Excelente","Reformado Recientemente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Montaña","Campo","Urbanas","Calle","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Gimnasio","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Doble acristalamiento","Amueblada","Parcialmente Equipada","Cocina Comedor","Comunitario","Comunitario"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","South","Excellent","Recently Renovated","Communal","Air Conditioning","Mountain","Country","Urban","Street","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Gym","Utility Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Double Glazing","Fully Furnished","Partially Fitted","Kitchen-Lounge","Communal","Communal"]},"piscina":true,"parking":true,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"0","ibi":"0","basura":"0"}}